# Top Down memoization - unoptimized
def eatApples(self, apples, days):

        dp = [0 for i in range(len(apples))]

        for i in range(len(apples)):

            if apples[i] == 0:
                dp[i] = 0
                continue

            dp[i] = max(dp[i - 1], sum(days))

            for j in range(i -1, -1, -1):
                if j - (i - 1 - j) > apples[i]:
                    break
                temp_i = i - 1 - j
                if (apples[temp_i] == 0):
                    continue
                else:
                    dp[i] = max(dp[i], 1 + dp[temp_i])
        return dp[-1]

